                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This study contains longitudinal questionnaire data (CPHQ2.0, EQ-5D, IPH-17) from Dutch adults across different health interventions, with sociodemographic characteristics, baseline and follow-up scores, and statistical comparisons of change sensitivity between instruments. Two measurements per participant:\n\nT0 (baseline): before or at the start of an intervention.\nT1 (follow-up): 1–6 months later, depending on the intervention.\n\nT0+T1:  n= 30"
